      "Courier's Three-Way Nail"),
    worldSite("J", "Forest of Screams", "north", 34, 3, "ruin",
      "The final failed Academy rescue crossed logging roads, litter camps, and beast dens. Killing what lives here cannot silence three nights of unheard survivors.",
      "An abandoned rescue marker bears a Roll Call name and a route ending at this point. No marks continue beyond it.",
      "Third Night Litter Note",
      "We heard them after dark. We could not reach them without losing the six already on the litter. I chose six. I still hear the seventh.",
      "Protective Anchor — a choice stated plainly because no justification made it painless",
